<title>HONG KONG: Boram Bank launches US$80 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Boram Bank launches US$80 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Standard Chartered Investment Banking.</p>
<p>BORROWER  BORAM BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$80 MLN				MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> COUPON    6ML+30BP IN YEAR ONE AND 6ML+37.5BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p> TYPE	FRN	   ISS PRICE   PAR	LAUNCH     14.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS	ANNUAL	CALLS	 NONE     REPLIES    **</p>
<p> LISTING   LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT   BULLET   DENOMS     US$500K</p>
<p> RATING    MOODY  BAA1 SALES LMTS  STANDARD FULL FEES  4BP</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF     YES	FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   ENGLISH     HOME CTRY   S KOREA  PAY DATE   30.OCT.96</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  SANWA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE AND STANDARD CHARTERED</p>
<p>		INVESTMENT BANKING</p>
<p> NOTES   **REPLY DEADLINE ON 15.OCT.96 AT 6:00PM HONG KONG TIME.</p>
<p>	   SIGNING IS SET FOR 23.OCT.96</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
